    "updated_at": "2015-12-18T14:40:48Z",
    "body": "Looking closer, I can't find any connection at all between HTML's various base URL concepts and [DOM's base URL](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document-base-url). The string \"concept-document-base-url\" appears nowhere in the generated HTML source, and the only link with exactly the text \"base URL\" is in [script settings for browsing contexts](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#script-settings-for-browsing-contexts) but in fact refers to HTML's [document base URL](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#document-base-url) concept like all the rest.\n\n@annevk, is this all entirely broken? How many concepts are the supposed to be, and how do they fit together?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
