    "body": "Drafted WPT just for `<iframe srcdoc>`: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/23130\r\n\r\nChromium: Takes snapshot of parent's base URL around the time of `<iframe srcdoc>`.\r\nFirefox: Reflects parent's updates dynamically.\r\n\r\n(The opposite direction from https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5474, where Chromium reflects parent's referrer policy updates while Firefox takes snapshot)",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
